Package: audioreach-calibration-data
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: AudioReach topology and calibration data
 Provides vendor-, chipset-, and board-specific data used by
 AudioReach components, including calibration key-value
 definitions for audio use cases.

